{"ref":"BDB, מִיכָא","hw":"מִיכָא","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">מִיכָא</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m.</strong> (so in Palm., Vog<sup>No. 36a</sup>).<br><strong>1.</strong>  son of Mephibosheth (𝔊 Μειχα), <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 9:12\" href=\"/II_Samuel.9.12\">2 S 9:12</a> (= <span dir=\"rtl\">מִיכָה</span> <strong>4</strong>).<br><strong>2.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 10:12\" href=\"/Nehemiah.10.12\">Ne 10:12</a>.<br><strong>3.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 11:17\" href=\"/Nehemiah.11.17\">Ne 11:17</a> (= <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 9:15\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.9.15\">1 Ch 9:15</a>), v <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 11:22\" href=\"/Nehemiah.11.22\">22</a> (called <span dir=\"rtl\">מִיכָיָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 12:35\" href=\"/Nehemiah.12.35\">12:35</a>).","next":"BDB, מִישָׁאֵל","prev":"BDB, מִיכָה"}